"confirmatory model they come from. FiabilityLab reports χ², CFI, TLI, RMSEA "
"(with 90% CI), and SRMR for the fitted model, following Hu &amp; Bentler's "
"(1999) cutoffs (CFI/TLI ≥ .95, RMSEA ≤ .06, SRMR ≤ .08 for good fit) — a "
"model with poor fit should be revised (or its structure reconsidered) before "
"its reliability numbers are reported."
