#: package.description
msgid ""
"FiabilityLab is a pedagogical jamovi module for evaluating reliability, "
"internal consistency, inter-rater agreement, confirmatory-factor-based (SEM) "
"reliability, and measurement invariance across groups. It integrates a "
"Library and Bibliography system to teach the theoretical foundations and "
"assumptions behind each statistic."
msgstr ""

