#: R/fiabilitylibrary.b.R
msgid ""
"The classical coefficients above (α, ω, GLB, ...) treat the scale's factor "
"structure as either unknown (a single common source) or only exploratorily "
"detected (parallel analysis). When the structure is already known — from "
"theory or a prior validation — the separate Advanced Reliability (SEM) "
"analysis lets the user assign items to named factors and fits a confirmatory "
"factor model (via lavaan/semTools) instead, giving structure-specific "
"reliability and validity evidence."
