#: R/fiabilitylibrary.b.R
msgid ""
"α's standard-error formula also assumes approximate multivariate normality "
"and unidimensionality (a single common factor). FiabilityLab's assumptions "
"check reuses the parallel-analysis factor count for the latter — so the same "
"three checks (tau-equivalence, normality, unidimensionality) that determine "
"whether α is trustworthy are reported together in one panel, the way "
"interRater reports ICC's normality/homoscedasticity/linearity checks "
"together."
msgstr ""

